            <ArticleTitle>Complete Genome Sequence of a Human Sapovirus GI.2 Variant, Isolated from a Patient in Ireland in 2016.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01028-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01028-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report here the first near-complete genome sequence (7,463 nucleotides) of a human sapovirus GI.2 variant from Dublin, Ireland, detected in an adult with gastroenteritis in 2016.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
